{
  "id": "156:1060",
  "texts": [
    "const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/98f69bf1-38f6-4b5f-a633-28cdad6fd90f\";\nconst imgFotografiaNavegacaoNoLagoCabaliana = `${assetPathPrefix}/2b1d6.png`;\nconst img16TransporteEAbastecimentoNoNorte = `${assetPathPrefix}/e6ce3.svg`;\nconst imgVector = `${assetPathPrefix}/03e35.svg`;\n\ntype EditorialMiniGlossarioProps = {\n  className?: string;\n  definicoes?: string;\n};\n\nfunction EditorialMiniGlossario({ className, definicoes = \"Sigla • significado.\" }: EditorialMiniGlossarioProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"[word-break:break-word] border border-[var(--margem-cor-linha,#c9cdbb)] border-solid content-stretch flex gap-[24px] h-[76px] items-start leading-[24px] p-[12px] relative rounded-[4px] text-[16px]\"} data-node-id=\"50:96\" data-name=\"Editorial / Mini glossário\">\n      <p className=\"font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold relative shrink-0 text-[color:var(----cor-terracota,#ad6c49)] w-[140px]\" data-node-id=\"50:97\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        GLOSSÁRIO\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal relative shrink-0 text-[color:var(--margem-cor-verde,#153b2e)] w-[1156px]\" data-node-id=\"50:98\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        {definicoes}\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function Component16TransporteEAbastecimentoNoNorte() {\n  return (\n    <a className=\"block cursor-pointer relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"156:1060\" data-name=\"16 • Transporte e abastecimento no Norte\">\n      <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img16TransporteEAbastecimentoNoNorte} />\n      <div className=\"absolute contents inset-[3.91%_79.38%_94.43%_3.33%]\" data-node-id=\"156:1062\" data-name=\"Rubrica\">\n        <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold inset-[3.91%_79.38%_94.43%_3.33%] leading-[normal] text-[#ad6c49] text-[16px] text-left whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"156:1063\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n          LOGÍSTICA E ABASTECIMENTO\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-[31.25%_3.33%_14.45%_67.78%]\" data-node-id=\"156:1064\" data-name=\"Vector\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgVector} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-[39.06%_3.33%_31.64%_67.78%]\" data-node-id=\"156:1065\" data-name=\"Fotografia • navegação no Lago Cabaliana\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute inset-0 max-w-none object-cover pointer-events-none size-full\" src={imgFotografiaNavegacaoNoLagoCabaliana} />\n      </div>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Libre_Baskerville:Regular'] font-normal inset-[7.81%_3.33%_86.52%_3.33%] leading-[58px] text-[#153b2e] text-[48px] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1066\">\n        Transporte e abastecimento no Norte\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal inset-[15.23%_3.33%_81.45%_3.33%] leading-[33.6px] text-[#153b2e] text-[24px] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1067\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        A circulação de alimentos no Norte depende de infraestrutura e renda. Em comunidades ribeirinhas, os rios são vias essenciais.\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Libre_Baskerville:Regular'] font-normal inset-[31.25%_67.78%_32.62%_3.33%] leading-[0] text-[#153b2e] text-[0px] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1068\">\n        <span className=\"leading-[64px] text-[64px]\">A</span>\n        <span className=\"font-['Archivo:Regular'] leading-[28px] text-[20px]\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>{` configuração geográfica da Região Norte afeta o abastecimento junto com renda, preços e acesso a serviços. Em áreas ribeirinhas, pequenas embarcações transportam pessoas e cargas; longas distâncias e dependência das hidrovias elevam o tempo e o custo da circulação. Para famílias de baixa renda, isso pode dificultar a compra de alimentos. No Amazonas, Neideana Ribeiro, especialista do Unicef em Manaus, ressalta a importância dos rios para o deslocamento e o abastecimento das comunidades.`}</span>\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal inset-[31.25%_35.56%_27.73%_35.56%] leading-[28px] text-[#153b2e] text-[20px] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1069\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>{`A especialista concedeu entrevista a Jhonny Lima, publicada no jornal A Crítica em 5 de outubro de 2025, na qual relaciona a vulnerabilidade regional ao isolamento e às estiagens severas de 2023 e 2024. Letícia Santos de Lima e colaboradores, em artigo publicado em Communications Earth & Environment em 2024, analisaram secas entre 2000 e 2020 com dados de 90 estações fluviométricas, localização de comunidades e registros de imprensa. O estudo identificou a combinação de baixos níveis dos rios, dificuldades de navegação e isolamento de comunidades com poucas alternativas terrestres.`}</p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Libre_Baskerville:Regular'] font-normal inset-[33.69%_5%_63.18%_69.44%] leading-[32px] text-[#f5ebdd] text-[24px] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1070\">\n        TRANSPORTE FLUVIAL\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal inset-[77.54%_5.35%_16.02%_69.1%] leading-[0] text-[15px] text-[color:var(--margem-cor-papel,#f2efdf)] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1071\" role=\"link\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }} tabIndex=\"0\">\n        <p className=\"cursor-pointer leading-[22px]\">Lago Cabaliana (AM), setembro de 2024. Navegação em águas rasas durante a estiagem. Foto: Raphael Alves/Agência Pública.</p>\n      </div>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal inset-[88.87%_3.33%_5.27%_3.33%] leading-[22.4px] text-[#67786b] text-[16px] text-left\" data-node-id=\"156:1072\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        Fontes: Banco Mundial, Food Insecurity and Food Inflation in Brazil (2023); IBGE, PNAD/POF e PNAD Contínua; Lima et al. (2024); Jhonny Lima, A Crítica (5 out. 2025). Série estadual do Amazonas; sem estimativa representativa em 2020. Referências completas nas pp. 22–23.\n      </p>\n      <EditorialMiniGlossario className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute border border-[var(--margem-cor-linha,#c9cdbb)] border-solid content-stretch flex gap-[24px] h-[76px] items-start leading-[24px] left-[48px] p-[12px] rounded-[4px] text-[16px] text-left top-[212px]\" definicoes=\"Unicef • Fundo das Nações Unidas para a Infância. Nesta página, os casos documentados no Amazonas ajudam a discutir o abastecimento na Região Norte.\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#d3d9d5] h-px left-[48px] top-[780px] w-[880px]\" data-node-id=\"298:869\" data-name=\"Leitura territorial • divisor superior\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#d3d9d5] h-[106px] left-[496px] top-[790px] w-px\" data-node-id=\"298:870\" data-name=\"Leitura territorial • divisor vertical\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[15px] leading-[14px] left-[48px] text-[#ad6c49] text-[11.5px] text-left top-[789px] w-[432px]\" data-node-id=\"298:871\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        PREÇOS DOS ALIMENTOS • BRASIL\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Libre_Baskerville:Regular'] font-normal h-[43px] leading-[40px] left-[48px] text-[#ad6c49] text-[34px] text-left top-[807px] w-[140px]\" data-node-id=\"298:872\">\n        37,5%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[49px] leading-[14.5px] left-[192px] text-[#153b2e] text-[12px] text-left top-[811px] w-[292px]\" data-node-id=\"298:873\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        Alta entre o fim de 2019 e o fim de 2022. O encarecimento pressionou sobretudo famílias de baixa renda; é contexto, não efeito isolado.\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[15px] leading-[14px] left-[512px] text-[#ad6c49] text-[11.5px] text-left top-[789px] w-[416px]\" data-node-id=\"298:874\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        AMAZONAS • DOMICÍLIOS COM INSEGURANÇA\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[26.142px] left-[525px] top-[829.86px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:875\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 2004\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[517px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[815.86px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:876\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        32,5%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[516px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:877\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        2004\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[26.235px] left-[581px] top-[829.76px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:878\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 2009\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[573px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[815.76px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:879\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        32,8%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[572px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:880\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        2009\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[29.387px] left-[637px] top-[826.61px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:881\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 2013\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[629px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[812.61px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:882\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        42,9%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[628px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:883\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        2013\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[36.44px] left-[693px] top-[819.56px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:884\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 17–18\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[685px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[805.56px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:885\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        65,5%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[684px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:886\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        17–18\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[38px] left-[749px] top-[818px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:887\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 21–22\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[741px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[804px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:888\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        70,5%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[740px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:889\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        21–22\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[29.294px] left-[805px] top-[826.71px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:890\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 2023\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[797px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[812.71px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:891\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        42,6%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[796px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:892\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        2023\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#ad6c49] h-[28.139px] left-[861px] top-[827.86px] w-[25px]\" data-node-id=\"298:893\" data-name=\"Amazonas • barra 2024\" />\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Bold'] font-bold h-[12px] leading-[11px] left-[853px] text-[#153b2e] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[813.86px] w-[42px]\" data-node-id=\"298:894\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        38,9%\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[14px] leading-[10px] left-[852px] text-[#153b2e] text-[8.5px] text-left top-[859px] w-[44px]\" data-node-id=\"298:895\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        2024\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Archivo:Regular'] font-normal h-[27px] leading-[11.5px] left-[512px] text-[#67786b] text-[9.5px] text-left top-[876px] w-[416px]\" data-node-id=\"298:896\" style={{ fontVariationSettings: '\"wdth\" 100' }}>\n        O pico (70,5%) caiu a 38,9% em 2024, ainda acima dos 37,6% do Norte. Sem estimativa estadual representativa para 2020; os levantamentos têm métodos distintos.\n      </p>\n    </a>\n  );\n}",
    "SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n",
